<title>USA: MBIA says has capacity for three N.Y. issuers.</title>
<headline>MBIA says has capacity for three N.Y. issuers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. said Tuesday it had limited secondary market insurance capacity for the following issues:</p>
<p>--NYS Dorm Authority (NYC Courts)</p>
<p>--NYC GOs</p>
<p>--NYC IDA (Terminal One Group Associates) &quot;TOGA&quot;</p>
<p>Please call 1-800-MBIA-NOW for latest prices.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
